:'''Dan Heng:''' ...I'm okay with that.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Me too.
::'''Huaiyan:''' Your willingness to help is truly heartwarming, youngsters.
::I object!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I object!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Will you let us come back...?
:'''Feixiao:''' Worried that I might go back on my word and keep you in The Shackling Prison? Relax, if I wanted to do that, you'd already be behind bars. Once you're done with your testimony, you're free to come and go as you please.
:'''Jing Yuan:''' Then, as the Merlin's Claw requests...
